&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://opinion.lawmaking.go.kr/gcom/admpp/45880"&gt;National Institute of Chemical Safety, draft amendment notice 2025-128 (Korean)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cirs-group.com/en/chemicals/south-korea-revises-hazardous-substance-list-refines-skin-corrosion-classification-adds-75-substances"&gt;CIRS, draft revision on skin corrosion classification, December 2025&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
