<title>Why 7 Out of 10 Korean Sunscreens Are SPF 50+</title>
<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.decodedkorea.org/2026/04/korean-sunscreen-spf-50-plus-data.html"/>
<published>2026-04-30T15:03:00Z</published>
<updated>2026-05-19T13:51:33.810Z</updated>
<category term="K-Beauty: Regulations"/>
