&lt;p style="line-height: 1.7; margin: 1em 0;"&gt;The online narrative that Korea banned oxybenzone does not match the regulatory record.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1.7; margin: 1em 0;"&gt;For more on how EU and Korean cosmetic regulations diverge, see our analysis of &lt;a href="https://www.decodedkorea.org/2026/04/banned-in-europe-legal-in-korea.html"&gt;ingredients banned in Europe but legal in Korea&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
