&lt;h2 style="margin-top: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Methodology and Sources&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1.7; margin: 1em 0;"&gt;The regulatory data in this article is cross-referenced against a structured database of 21,796 cosmetic ingredients with regulatory records spanning 10 countries and 31,191 regulatory entries:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style="line-height: 1.7; margin: 1em 0;"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EU:&lt;/strong&gt; Cosmetics Regulation EC 1223/2009, Annex II (Prohibited Substances) and Annex IV (Colorants)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Korea:&lt;/strong&gt; MFDS Cosmetic Ingredient Standards (식품의약품안전처 화장품 원료 기준)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other markets:&lt;/strong&gt; Regulatory data sourced from official databases of Taiwan, US, China, ASEAN, Brazil, Argentina, and Canada&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1.7; margin: 1em 0;"&gt;This analysis is part of an ongoing series comparing cosmetic ingredient regulations across global markets. The underlying database is available as a structured API for regulatory professionals and developers who need to run multi-country compliance checks programmatically — see the &lt;a href="https://rapidapi.com/han8212/api/k-beauty-cosmetic-ingredients"&gt;K-Beauty Cosmetic Ingredients API on RapidAPI&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
